351	 * It was dead in the UI and live on the network. Nothing rendered OrderForm, but
352	 * lib/actions.ts carries `"use server"`, so `orderServer` remained a
353	 * network-callable endpoint that provisioned VMs and debited wallets — the same
354	 * property that made `verifyTotpForUser` a public 2FA oracle.
